            'blocks'  => [
                [ 'p', 'DTF printing means printing a design onto PET film, coating it with adhesive powder, curing it and pressing it onto fabric with a heat press. Thanks to a layer of white ink, it works on cotton, polyester and blends in any colour, including black T-shirts, and it makes sense even for single pieces. For mugs, phone cases and other hard items, UV printing or UV DTF transfers are the better choice.' ],
