                [ 'h2', 'How does DTF printing work, step by step?' ],
                [ 'p', 'DTF stands for “direct to film”. A DTF printer doesn’t print on the T-shirt itself but on a special film, from which the finished design is later transferred to the fabric. The process has four stages:' ],
