                [ 'p', 'Screen printing needs a separate screen for each colour, so set-up costs time and money. For large runs of one design, though, the cost per piece is the lowest and plastisol inks are very hard-wearing. For single pieces and multi-colour photos it doesn’t pay off.' ],
